<title>PHILIPPINES: RFC to buy 30 pct stake in Philippine bank.</title>
<headline>RFC to buy 30 pct stake in Philippine bank.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial service firm RFC Inc said on Monday it had agreed to buy 30 percent stake in Unitrust Development Bank, one of the small-sized private development banks in the Philippines.</p>
<p>Corporate secretary Mario Lorenzo told the Philippine Stock Exchange the purchase was in fulfillment of a previous agreement by both parties.</p>
<p>He did not give details.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
